  "summary": "A multi-stage Android malware chain (JarService dropper, loader, clicker/reverse-proxy loader) delivered to DoFun automotive head units through the legitimate TWCore updater (com.tw.core) and its MQTT-driven APK installer. The final stage installs the \"zhima\" reverse-proxy module to build a proxy botnet and perform ad fraud, with configuration and commands pulled from C2 JSON APIs. Kaspersky attributes the campaign with high confidence to the MoYu Group, an actor linked to the BADBOX botnet.",
